---

Install **SC Final Adventure - Arcana** from [CurseForge](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/sc-final-adventure-arcana) (NeoForge **1.21.1**).

There is no separate guidebook. Progression lives in **Advancements**:

1. Join a world and press **L**.
2. Open the **Arcana** tab. That chapter tree is the pack’s quest map.
3. You receive an **Arcane Decree** automatically.
4. Craft or find a **Bounty Board**, place the decree on it, and take your first contract.

Mod advancements (Apotheosis world tiers, recipe unlocks, and similar) stay enabled so dependent systems keep working. Follow Arcana chapters to unlock new decrees, gear tiers, boss hunts, and endgame mastery.

If the instance includes [Spell Actionbar](/mods/spell-actionbar) and [Spell Codex](/mods/spell-codex), use those pages for the cast HUD and Codex unlock loop.
